# rm removes tracked file from worktree and stages a removal;
# rm of an untracked file is rejected and the file survives
I definitions.inc
> init
<<<
+ wug.txt wug.txt
+ nota.txt nota.txt
> add wug.txt
<<<
> commit "v1"
<<<
> rm wug.txt
<<<
* wug.txt
E .gitlet/Stage/Remove/wug.txt
> rm nota.txt
No reason to remove the file.
<<<
